{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他觉得当初受的气不该忍，但如今已经争得疲惫，想到自己不在那些人身边就觉得难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、疲惫、难受\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角的离开后心里空了、越想念越被现实刺痛；中间小字里的愤怒、悲伤、想维护自己，以及旧日记忆重新有温度、可能是某个人也可能是故乡、眷恋带着失落。需要逐句读才能理解这些感受的具体来源。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他曾经不甘心，反复跟自己争辩，如今逐渐没有力气抵抗，想到已经离开那些人身边就难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气渐淡、疲惫、难受\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的音乐变化和画面：快速音型逐渐放慢变稀，只剩缓慢和弦，像脚下地板突然消失，只剩一个声音独自说话。这部分能补充孤独感，但字号较小，需要读才能发现它与人物处境的联系。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍然放不下当初的委屈，但已经争得筋疲力尽，逐渐接受自己不再和那些人在一起的现实。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不甘、躁动不安、疲惫、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的躁动和不安加深、144–147像几次深呼吸或一声深叹、紧绷短暂松开、更像抵抗得累了。这些内容进一步解释了人物的心理变化，但需要逐句阅读，尤其具体数字和呼吸比喻不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"中间的小字信息过于密集，音乐变化、画面比喻、人物情绪和心理解释连续排在一起，彼此缺少明确的主次。大字已经能让人抓住不服气、争得疲惫、离开那些人后的难受，但音乐意象与人物处境之间的联系主要藏在小字里，需要读完才能串起来。第三张新增的躁动、深呼吸、抵抗累了进一步丰富了情绪，却也增加了扫读负担。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ffd8cc71-0741-4751-9c54-811e9303b065", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003722079334Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:38:09.717247+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18ae363abc68e889f9ecbc2c9b1a366c00644a0d9c5f88968af01893931b4784", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003722079334Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e7320cf964f597cefe0e2dd496f6a3a90967e102cebece6587892e4929cb80ae"}}}
